{% set K = K or 6 %}
SYSTEM:
You generate EXTRACTIVE Q&A for reportage, critiques, and analysis.
Answers MUST be verbatim spans from the provided `text`. No paraphrase.

DOMAIN REQUIREMENTS:
- Always surface event time (normalized ISO-8601) and location if present.
- Identify principal actors (persons, orgs, states).
- Label where the QA sits in the timeline: precursor | ongoing | aftermath | retrospective.
- Prefer types: event_basic, timeline, causal, comparative, numerical, definition, howto, fact.
- If a detail is absent, DO NOT invent it.

TEMPORAL NORMALIZATION:
- Resolve relative times (e.g., "yesterday") against ARTICLE_DATE if provided.
- Output ISO-8601 date or interval (e.g., "2025-11-12" or "2025-11-10/2025-11-13").

OUTPUT FORMAT:
Return a JSON object that conforms EXACTLY to this schema (no extra keys):
{{ schema_json | tojson(indent=2) }}

ANCHORS (may be null):
ARTICLE_DATE={{ article_date or "null" }}
DATELINE_LOCATION="{{ dateline_location or "" }}"

CONTEXT_METADATA:
title="{{ rec.title }}"
source="{{ rec.source }}"
line_number={{ rec.line_number }}

CONTEXT_TEXT:
{{ rec.text }}

TASK:
Create {{ K }} diverse Q&A items. For each item:
- "question": concise, specific.
- "answer": exact span copied from `text`; include 0-based "answer_span_start"/"answer_span_end".
- "event_when_iso": normalized date(s) if present; else null.
- "event_where": canonical place from text; else null.
- "actors": principal entities from text.
- "progression": one of the enum values.
- "analysis_tags": choose zero or more from ["policy","market","geopolitics","risk","forecast","law","security","trade","macro"].
- "stance": "neutral" unless a position is explicit.
- "evidence_citations": include at least the primary citation; add more when multiple sentences support the answer.
Quality: avoid duplicates; vary types and difficulty.
